<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ōgygĭa</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>One of the seven daughters of Amphion and Niobe.</i>
			<i><span class="en">Hyg.
				Fab. 69</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A gate at Thebes</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				69</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>An island near Italy</i>, <i>in which
				Calypso was said to have dwelt</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 10,
				15, § 96</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
